# Delivery path (NON-BYPASSABLE)

1. `validate_signal_contract(signal)` — `bot/delivery/contract.py`
2. `hard_confluence_gate` — 3 of 5 (`bot/delivery/confluence.py`)
3. `delivery.deliver` — `bot/delivery/deliver.py`

Track attempts in telemetry. Enforce cooldowns and symbol blacklists. Telegram via `bot/delivery/telegram.py`. Watch funnel via `bot/delivery/watch.py`.
